OL,5,G1600 Secret Nazi Bases
OL,6,     FThe Secrets of Nazi Future Tech:
OL,7,     FHidden in a remote mountainous
OL,8,     Fforest is a structure nicknamed
OL,9,     Fthe Fly Trap or Hitler's
OL,10,     FStonehenge. Researchers still have
OL,11,     Fno definitive idea what it is.
OL,12,G1700 Auschwitz: The Nazis and the Final
OL,13,G     Solution
OL,14,     FFactories of Death: Charting the
OL,15,     Fevolution of Auschwitz. Hear more
OL,16,     Fabout the biggest single killing
OL,17,     Fyear in the history of the Nazis'
OL,18,     Fmonstrous Final Solution.
